  1. `requireWorkspace(tc)`.
  2. Not exactly one of `runId`/`tasksDir` → `{ isError: true, text: "pass exactly one of runId and tasksDir" }`.
  3. `runId`: `runDirOrError(ws, runId)`; node ids from `(await runDetail(ws, runId))?.graph?.nodes.map((n) => n.id) ?? []`. Unknown node → `unknown node <node> in run <runId>; nodes: <ids joined with ", ">`.
